{
  "name": "TXT2IMG - SDXL",
  "author": "Pfannkuchensack",
  "description": "Callable text-to-image sub workflow (SDXL). Returns image + latents + metadata.",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "contact": "",
  "tags": "callable, sub workflow, txt2img, SDXL",
  "notes": "Pfannkuchensacks Workflow Package\n\nCallable sub workflow for the \"Call Saved Workflow\" node.\n\nReturns three named values:\n  image     - the finished image (use this to chain into the next call)\n  latents   - the raw latents (usable, but the editor cannot wire a LatentsField\n              into a Call Saved Workflow node yet, so chain on \"image\")\n  metadata  - core metadata for the run\n\nEvery workflow in this series uses the SAME node ids and field names for its\nshared inputs, so swapping the selected workflow on a Call Saved Workflow node\nkeeps the existing wiring intact.\n\nNote: the model is set on the loader node inside this workflow. It is not written\ninto the metadata, because the Z-Image and Krea-2 loaders only accept a directly\nselected model (Input.Direct) and no loader outputs a model identifier, so there\nis no single source of truth to wire into core_metadata.model.",
